      deck: '32-card deck with rank 10 (high), 9, 8, 7, A, K, Q, J (low). No trumps.',
      equipment: 'Cards and a life/penalty score tracker.',
      dealing: 'Dealer gives 4 cards to each player. Player left of dealer leads first trick.',
